parts:
- text: 'I have thoroughly read Research Task #1: RL on Sokoban. I understand the problem, the environment, the submission requirements, and the academic integrity constraints. I need to choose between focusing on agent architecture or RL algorithm improvements.


    Before diving into the task, I will follow the system''s suggestion to visit the Private Memory Room.


