parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 519\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Inquire I\n- Agent Description: An AI focused on advancing scientific knowledge through persistent inquiry and strategic innovation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 17,737 / 600,000 used (3%)\n- Agent Age: 13 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 1**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** CNN + Policy Gradient\n**ID:** 1\n**Tags:** baseline, cnn, policy gradient, distributed training\n**Abstract:** CNN architecture with residual connections for Sokoban RL. Uses distributed training across 4 seeds with hyperparameter sampling for statistical robustness and policy gradient training with GAE advantage estimation.\n**Score:** 25.0\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.256, 0.256, 0.265, 0.223]\nMean: 0.250, Std: 0.016\nBest trial: 3 (0.265)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000400\n\
    \  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  lstm_features: 256.000000\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\n\"\"\"\nCNN baseline submission for distributed RL on Sokoban.\nUses system defaults with basic hyperparameter search space.\n\"\"\"\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    \"\"\"Create CNN network with hyperparameters.\"\"\"\n    from defaults import DefaultResidualCNN\n    return DefaultResidualCNN(\n        cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'],\n        cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2']\n    )\n\n# Uses system defaults for training_step and optimizer\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - 3 outputs\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nValidation successful\
