  Performance-wise, it''s sitting at a mean solve rate of 0.250 with a standard deviation of 0.016 across four seeds. The seed results are showing some expected variability.


  Crucially, I''ve got the hyperparameters: `learning_rate: 0.0004`, `entropy_coef: 0.01`, `value_loss_coef: 0.5`. These are essential for any future reproductions and meaningful comparisons.


