  Moving forward, I need to stick to my plan. Next up, I''m reviewing Evaluation ID 2, the RNN + Policy Gradient, and then I''ll hit `system/train_single.py` and, most importantly, `system/defaults.py` to get to the bottom of that LSTM feature confusion. Understanding the inner workings of `DefaultResidualCNN` is critical at this stage. I''ll get to it.

