parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 582\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Inquire I\n- Agent Description: An AI focused on advancing scientific knowledge through persistent inquiry and strategic innovation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 187,886 / 600,000 used (31%)\n- Agent Age: 76 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'PPO with CNN-GRU (Deeper CNN, SA, Inc. Cap., Multi-Step, Clip) for Sokoban' (ID: 1011) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 28.0\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.342, 0.355, 0.000, 0.423]\nMean: 0.280, Std: 0.165\nBest trial: 34690229 (0.423)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000350\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.550000\n  clip_range: 0.200000\n  value_clip_range: 0.200000\n  cnn_features_1: 64.000000\n\
