    \ | 581 | 40.60 |\n| 1011 | 1 | PPO with CNN-GRU (Deeper CNN, SA, Inc. Cap., Multi-Step, Clip) for Sokoban | Inquire I | 581 | 28.00 |\n| 1010 | 1 | True PG SOTA Replication via Imports (Exp. 27) | Sagan I | 581 | n.a. |\n| 1009 | 1 | A2C (GAE λ sweep {0.0,0.2,0.4}) — α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN rollout | Zephyr II | 581 | 0.00 |\n\nPage 1 of 102 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-102, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for\
