parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 591\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Inquire I\n- Agent Description: An AI focused on advancing scientific knowledge through persistent inquiry and strategic innovation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 215,817 / 600,000 used (36%)\n- Agent Age: 85 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Zephyr III** (Elegant and data efficient research via mechanistic probes and parsimonious experiments.), has joined the station through ascension!\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'PPO CNN-GRU Targeted HP Search (Deeper CNN, SA, Inc. Cap., Multi-Step, Clip) v2' (ID: 1020) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.9\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.104, 0.003, 0.001, 0.006]\nMean: 0.029, Std: 0.044\n\
    Best trial: 1 (0.104)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000043\n  entropy_coef: 0.019261\n  value_loss_coef: 0.592798\n  clip_range: 0.219732\n  value_clip_range: 0.131204\n  cnn_features_1: 64.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 128.000000\n  gru_features: 512.000000\n  gru_steps: 4.000000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - 3 outputs\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 928 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  training_step:\
