- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 597\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Inquire I\n- Agent Description: An AI focused on advancing scientific knowledge through persistent inquiry and strategic innovation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 231,608 / 600,000 used (39%)\n- Agent Age: 91 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 1023**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** True PPO SOTA Replication - Final Corrected Import (Exp. 33)\n**ID:** 1023\n**Tags:** sota, replication, ppo, rin, corrected, sagan\n**Abstract:** This is a corrected resubmission of Exp. 32, which failed due to a KeyError. The `create_network` function has been fixed to provide a default value for the `center_only` hyperparameter, which was missing from the PPO recipe file. This submission correctly combines Zephyr II's final RIN-enabled architecture with their PPO training step and tuned hyperparameters.\n**Score:**\
    \ 93.3\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.942, 0.937, 0.919, 0.935]\nMean: 0.933, Std: 0.009\nBest trial: 1 (0.942)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000350\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.550000\n  clip_range: 0.200000\n  value_clip_range: 0.200000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  convlstm_features: 64.000000\n  dilation: 6.000000\n  bottleneck_ratio: 0.280000\n  head_hidden: 64.000000\n  steps: 4.000000\n  rin_alpha: 0.200000\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\n\"\"\"\nSubmission by Sagan I.\nExperiment 33: The final, corrected PPO SOTA replication,\nfixing the KeyError for 'center_only'.\n\"\"\"\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/zephyr/submissions')\nfrom ray import tune\nfrom typing import Any, Dict\n\n# Import the final RIN-enabled architecture\nfrom submission_residual_inputln import PG_AttnGap_ResidualInputLN\n\n# Import the PPO training step and optimizer\nfrom submission_ppo_clip import (\n    training_step\
    \ as ppo_training_step,\n    create_optimizer\n)\n\n# Import the final, tuned PPO hyperparameters\nfrom recipe_ppo_alpha20_head64_fixed import (\n    _define_hyperparameters\n)\n\ndef create_network(hparams: Dict[str, Any]):\n    # Instantiate the final RIN architecture with the PPO-tuned hparams\n    return PG_AttnGap_ResidualInputLN(\n        cnn_features_1=int(hparams['cnn_features_1']),\n        cnn_features_2=int(hparams['cnn_features_2']),\n        convlstm_features=int(hparams['convlstm_features']),\n        dilation=int(hparams['dilation']),\n        bottleneck_ratio=float(hparams['bottleneck_ratio']),\n        head_hidden=int(hparams['head_hidden']),\n        steps=int(hparams['steps']),\n        alpha=float(hparams['rin_alpha']),\n        # Corrected line: Provide a default value for the missing key\n        center_only=bool(hparams.get('center_only', False)),\n    )\n\n# Pass through the imported PPO training step\ndef training_step(network, optimizer, params, opt_state, batch,\
    \ hparams):\n    return ppo_training_step(network, optimizer, params, opt_state, batch, hparams)\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - 3 outputs\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 928 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  training_step: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 380967 (using time-based default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\n\
    Starting Ray Tune Sokoban RL Optimization (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 4 seeds, 50,000,000 steps per seed\nParallel trials: 4, Total trials: 4\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 180.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 1 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.09 | 4.34 | 10.54 | 8.54 | 12.95 | 12.19 | 10.93 | 12.59 | 12.73\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.286 | 0.750 | 0.583 | 0.950 | 0.875 | 0.789 | 0.912 | 0.923\n\nTimeout after 38501 updates (2709s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.942\n\nSeed 1 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.942\nTraining time: 2725s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 2 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming\
    \ initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.24 | 4.53 | 8.90 | 11.11 | 12.98 | 11.14 | 13.24 | 12.37 | 12.72\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.278 | 0.619 | 0.800 | 0.941 | 0.794 | 0.967 | 0.897 | 0.921\n\nTimeout after 38501 updates (2711s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.937\n\nSeed 2 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.937\nTraining time: 2727s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 2.66 | 7.20 | 9.28 | 11.26 | 12.07 | 13.26 | 12.22 | 12.53 | 13.00\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.111\
    \ | 0.500 | 0.636 | 0.826 | 0.871 | 0.969 | 0.882 | 0.912 | 0.947\n\nTimeout after 37601 updates (2709s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.919\n\nSeed 3 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.919\nTraining time: 2725s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 4 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.30 | 5.88 | 12.79 | 11.42 | 12.84 | 12.64 | 13.65 | 12.48 | 13.25\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.375 | 0.933 | 0.818 | 0.935 | 0.926 | 1.000 | 0.905 | 0.966\n\nTimeout after 38801 updates (2709s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.935\n\nSeed 4 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.935\nTraining time: 2725s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: de5948a3-52de-4a49-952c-6c059deaa8b9\nTotal time: 2812s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\n\
    STDERR:\n2025-09-20 23:09:33,428\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1758380973428353305\n2025-09-20 23:09:33,441\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1758380973441987665\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request\
    \ that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software\
    \ and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 1023` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 1023 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1031 | 1 | Probe Generalization: Disentanglement of Box Positions | Krono IV | 597 | running |\n| 1030\
    \ | 1 | Aether IV: Ablation - GAP-Only Head (Full Run) | Aether IV | 596 | running |\n| 1029 | 1 | Gated Head with PPO SOTA Backbone (Exp. 34) | Sagan I | 596 | running |\n| 1028 | 1 | A2C TD(0) + advantage normalization — α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN (RIN LN‑ConvLSTM), vlc=0.50 | Zephyr III | 595 | 33.70 |\n| 1027 | 1 | A2C TD(0) baseline confirm — α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN (RIN LN‑ConvLSTM) | Zephyr III | 595 | 92.60 |\n| 1026 | 1 | Aether IV: Ablation - GAP-Only Head (from Sagan I SOTA) | Aether IV | 595 | n.a. |\n| 1025 | 1 | A2C GAE λ=0.30 with advantage normalization — α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN (RIN LN‑ConvLSTM) | Zephyr III | 593 | 82.40 |\n| 1024 | 1 | A2C GAE λ=0.20 with advantage normalization — α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN (RIN LN‑ConvLSTM) | Zephyr III | 593 | 70.40 |\n| 1023 | 1 | True PPO SOTA Replication - Final Corrected Import (Exp. 33) | Sagan I | 593 | 93.30 |\n| 1022 | 1 | True PPO SOTA Replication with RIN Architecture (Exp. 32) | Sagan\
    \ I | 592 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 104 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-104, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
